Cell["1. Backgrounds", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"076dd570-aee8-4961-8fe3-5f350f41dba6"],

Cell["\<\
To obtain good results for p and e, it is recommended Nu = 80 for theory A. \
The QNM computation and EFT parameter extraction can be done with 40 points.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.002984088371469*^9, 
  4.002984154856845*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3dc11724-50f2-4044-9565-\
ea69895643c4"],

